      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I received 5 quotes from different companies and conducted hours of research into the latest systems and current technologies being offered. The guys from Alternate Electrical not only under cut all other quotes but were so much ahead of the others in relation to providing the latest products with the professional knowledge and advice to back said products. I have 24 Trina Honey panels with an SMA Inverter. The guys were friendly, punctual and polite. Something I am definitely not used to when dealing with tradesman. Simon and his team take their work very seriously and are a credit to their trade. I've had my system running for a week now and am generating up to 38.5kw of power a day. I am very happy and excited about my system. I have and will continue to recommend Simon and his team from Alternate Electrical to anyone and everyone interested in Solar Power. Don't get ripped off. Check these guys out first before signing anything. Thank you Simon and your team for your excellent service and quality system. I'm so glad Solar Quotes recommended you.",
